<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Intel, AMD cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Intel, AMD cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cowen &amp; Co said analyst Drew Peck downgraded Intel Corp to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Also cut Advanced Micro Devices Inc to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>-- Analyst not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Advanced Micro fell 1-5/8 to 37-3/4.</p>
<p>-- Shares in Intel fell 4-7/8 to 142-5/8.</p>
</text>
